sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as Send API / hogflow
    participant DB as cyclotron_jobs
    participant Main as Main email fleet
    participant Fast as Fast email fleet
    participant Bucket as SES bucket
    participant Send as executeSendEmail
    Main->>DB: count, claim, dequeue a large batch (priority first)
    Main->>Send: processBatch(bulk rows), awaits the slowest row
    API->>DB: insert priority 0 row
    Fast->>DB: countWork(priority <= 0, about 20)
    Fast->>Bucket: claimBatchLimit(visible), same hook as the main fleet
    Fast->>DB: fairDequeue(priority <= 0), SKIP LOCKED
    Fast->>Send: processBatch(fast rows) on its own event loop
    Send-->>API: SES handoff, then the workflow's next steps until a delay
